Use safe unique filenames, validate uploads, and prevent path traversal. Do not execute uploaded files.

If the deployment uses an ephemeral filesystem and SQLite/files would not persist reliably across deployments, reuse an existing persistent database/storage service where available or document the limitation clearly. Do not claim durable storage when it is not available.

